cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use PVMSim, please cite the software repository as follows."
title: "PVMSim: A MATLAB App for Reproducible Double-Diode Parameter Extraction from Measured Photovoltaic Current-Voltage Curves"
version: "1.0"
date-released: 2026-03-15
type: software
license: MIT
repository-code: "https://github.com/pvmsim/PVMSim"
url: "https://github.com/pvmsim/PVMSim"
abstract: "PVMSim is a MATLAB application for reproducible parameter extraction of the double-diode photovoltaic model from measured current-voltage curves. It provides an interactive App Designer interface and a scriptable command-line workflow for exploratory use and headless batch runs. The software supports traceable reruns through exported configuration snapshots, logs, tabular summaries, MATLAB result files, and integrity hashes."
keywords:
  - Double-diode model
  - I–V curves 
  - Metaheuristic optimization 
  - Photovoltaic 
  - Reproducible workflow
